 "remarks": "474 W Main Street is an rare opportunity for a retail or office owner operator w/ 3 additional apartments & large unfinished basement which has not been available for sale in 50 years. There is on-street & off-street parking. Conveniently close to I-95 entrance/exit (Exit 6) as well as, Greenwich Town Line and Downtown Stamford. The store has Central Air in the front & wall unit heat/AC in the back. Sep Utils (Heat & Electric) for store & all apartments. Billboard on west side of building is additional income. Store has 1/2 bath, 1 apt has updated bath, another apt has brand new bath. Contact List Agents for Income, Expenses & Lease details.",
